        "text": "Good morning team! 🌅 Time for our daily standup. Please share your updates:\n\n📝 **What did you accomplish yesterday?**\n🎯 **What are you working on today?**\n🚧 **Any blockers or challenges?**\n\nI'll collect responses for the next 2 hours and provide a summary. Thanks!",
