    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n* Configure Slack credentials in the Slack nodes (Send Standup Request, Collect Responses)\n* Configure OpenAI API key in the OpenAI Chat Model node\n* Configure Slack credentials in the Slack Tool node\n* Configure Google Docs credentials in the Google Docs Tool node\n* Update the Workflow Configuration node:\n* Set slackChannel to your desired channel (e.g., \"#standup\")\n* Set responseWindowHours to your preferred collection time (default: 2)\n* Set googleDocsId to your Google Docs document ID for archiving\n* Set archiveToGoogleDocs to true/false based on your preference\n\n**Adjust the schedule trigger time if needed (default: 9 AM weekdays)**\n\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\nThe workflow runs automatically every weekday morning at 9 AM. It will:\n\n* Send a standup request message to your designated Slack channel\n* Wait for the configured response window (2 hours by default)\n* Collect all responses from the channel\n* Use AI to analyze and create a structured summary\n* Post the summary as a threaded reply to the original message\n* Optionally archive the summary to Google Docs with timestamps",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 704
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -880,
        -128
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4568f48b-42ce-44d8-9783-f75591bd24c3",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    }
